    },
    {
      "id": "claim_66768fa8c9974cdd8bb825bd126c942b",
      "statement": "src/hooks.ts owns the single ordered features array — the only place that knows all features; array order is start order and stop runs in reverse (the organizer's MenuManager menu is registered first and unregistered last). Registering a new capability means adding a Feature object to this array; nothing else wires it up.",
