    {
      "id": "claim_618ce10260ef4bf290ada95ff19f4d26",
      "statement": "Prototype patches live in start and are undone in stop through assignChecked (assign, read back, compare identity), which distinguishes a silently failed patch from a successful one. Patch features guard against double installation and hold the original function so stop restores it: citeOnlyPatch replaces Zotero.Integration.Session.prototype._insertCitingResult, returns early when already patched, and unpatch() restores the native function.",
