      "id": "claim_1b8b34f80ae04a40911761e606f3a18b",
      "statement": "The plugin instance is wired before any lifecycle hook runs: addon/bootstrap.js registers the chrome mapping, loads the bundle into the plugin sandbox with ignoreCache, and forwards startup/shutdown/main-window callbacks to Zotero.FlexAnnotate.hooks; src/index.ts creates the Addon singleton (data, hooks, api), defines the ztoolkit global as a getter over addon.data.ztoolkit, and registers the instance as Zotero[config.addonInstance] — the global bootstrap and the Zotero tests use to reach the plugin.",
