      "id": "claim_892da76a26f24b1db3f5023a38d48e52",
      "statement": "onStartup awaits Zotero.initializationPromise, unlockPromise and uiReadyPromise (no feature runs before Zotero is usable), then initLocale, then builds addon.api, then registers the preference pane, then awaits startAll(features), then runs onMainWindowLoad for every open main window, and only then sets addon.data.initialized = true as the last step.",
      "evidence": [
