      "statement": "Per main window, onMainWindowLoad creates a fresh ZToolkit, inserts the two Fluent files (flexannotate-mainWindow.ftl and flexannotate-addon.ftl) and awaits addToWindow(features, win); onMainWindowUnload runs removeFromWindow(features, win), ztoolkit.unregisterAll() and closes an open plugin dialog window.",
